│ patch_description        │ Restructure into a modular pipeline: (1) a staggered hex-row layout generator places 26   │
│                          │ centers in 5 rows (5,6,5,6,4 pattern), (2) radii are computed by an exact linear program  │
│                          │ (maximize Σr subject to pairwise distance and wall constraints) instead of the lossy      │
│                          │ greedy pairwise scaling — this alone drastically improves the achievable sum, (3) a       │
│                          │ bounded hill-climbing refinement perturbs center positions and re-solves the LP,          │
│                          │ accepting only improvements, so edge gaps get filled by naturally larger corner circles.  │
│                          │ A scipy-free fallback preserves the old pairwise scaling if scipy is unavailable. Same    │
│                          │ interface (construct_packing returning centers, radii, sum) is maintained.                │
