│                          │ hill-climb and improves the starting basin. (2) Multi-start the hill-climb: currently     │
│                          │ only the single best seed gets climb time; instead run a short climb from the top few     │
│                          │ seeds and keep the best result — different seeds reach different local optima, and        │
│                          │ AlphaEvolve-level configurations often sit in basins not reachable from the single best   │
│                          │ LP seed.                                                                                  │
