│                          │ search; (2) multi-start hill-climb with per-start Metropolis acceptance and best-ever     │
│                          │ tracking on the top-screened basins only; (3) final exact-LP polish. Key insight:         │
│                          │ boundary clustering (6-count edge rows) leaves large corner gaps that LP radii can        │
│                          │ exploit with bigger corner circles, matching AlphaEvolve-level structure.                 │
