│                          │ ([6,5,5,5,6], [6,5,6,5,4], [5,6,4,6,5]) and add vertical mirrors of each layout, since    │
│                          │ the sparse LP screen already handles any center configuration at negligible cost. These   │
│                          │ patterns concentrate circles near the square's edges where the AlphaEvolve 2.635 regime   │
│                          │ benefits from boundary-hugging circles (wall constraints allow larger radii at            │
│                          │ corners/edges), and mirroring doubles the effective seed pool for free, improving the     │
│                          │ hill-climb starting points. Also broaden the starting-pool for hill-climbing slightly     │
│                          │ (top 3 → top 4) to leverage the larger seed set, and add a mid-density vscale value.      │
